Tang Bangzuo 唐邦佐 (courtesy name Weiliang 惟良, a native of Lanxi County 蘭谿縣, Zhejiang 浙江, and a metropolitan graduate [jinshi] of the wuchen year [1568]), Assistant Prefect (tongpan) of Ganzhou Prefecture 贛州府;
Chang Jujing 常居敬 (courtesy name Weiyi 惟一, a native of Jiangxia County 江夏縣, Huguang 湖廣, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Prefectural Judge (tuiguan) of Nanchang Prefecture 南昌府;
Xu Gui 徐桂 (courtesy name Maowu 茂吳, registered in Yuhang County 餘杭縣, Zhejiang, a native of Changzhou County 長洲縣, Southern Metropolitan Region [Zhili 直隸], and a metropolitan graduate of the dingchou year [1577]), Prefectural Judge of Yuanzhou Prefecture 袁州府;
Li Deyou 李得祐 (courtesy name Tianji 天吉, a native of Yibin County 宜賓縣, Sichuan 四川, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Magistrate (zhixian) of Nanchang County 南昌縣, Nanchang Prefecture;
Zhang Dong 張棟 (courtesy name Boren 伯任, a native of Kunshan County 崑山縣, Southern Metropolitan Region, and a metropolitan graduate of the dingchou year [1577]), Magistrate of Xinjian County 新建縣, Nanchang Prefecture;
Wang Bingxuan 王炳璿 (courtesy name Youwen 幼文, a native of Kunshan County, Southern Metropolitan Region, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Magistrate of Shangrao County 上饒縣, Guangxin Prefecture 廣信府;
Guo Weixian 郭惟賢 (courtesy name Zheqing 哲卿, a native of Jinjiang County 晋江縣, Fujian 福建, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Magistrate of Qingjiang County 清江縣, Linjiang Prefecture 臨江府;
Fan Lai 范淶 (courtesy name Yuanyi 原易, a native of Xiuning County 休寧縣, Southern Metropolitan Region, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Magistrate of Nancheng County 南城縣, Jianchang Prefecture 建昌府.

Sealing Officials (Mifeng guan 彌封官):
Zhang Daoming 張道明 (courtesy name Xingfu 行甫, registered in the Rear Imperial Bodyguard [Jinwu houwei 金吾後衛], a native of Yuyao County 餘姚縣, Zhejiang, and a metropolitan graduate of the wuchen year [1568]), Assistant Prefect of Ganzhou Prefecture;
Ma Guan 馬貫 (courtesy name Daoqing 道卿, a native of Wujiang County 吳江縣, Southern Metropolitan Region, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Prefectural Judge of Jiujiang Prefecture 九江府;
Yang Zhou 楊洲 (courtesy name Wendeng 文登, a native of Qiantang County 錢塘縣, Zhejiang, and a tribute scholar [gongshi] of the dingmao year [1567]), Prefectural Judge of Ruizhou Prefecture 瑞州府;
Lu Mengxiong 陸夢熊 (courtesy name Boxiang 伯祥, a native of Yuyao County, Zhejiang, and a metropolitan graduate of the xinwei year [1571]), Magistrate of Yanshan County 鉛山縣, Guangxin Prefecture;
Gong Xijue 龔錫爵 (courtesy name Ruxiu 汝修, a native of Jiading County 嘉定縣, Southern Metropolitan Region, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Magistrate of Yongxin County 永新縣, Ji'an Prefecture 吉安府;
Cai Guobing 蔡國炳 (courtesy name Chengzhong 誠中, a native of Jinjiang County, Fujian, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Magistrate of Yongfeng County 永豐縣, Guangxin Prefecture;
Tang Boyuan 唐伯元 (courtesy name Renqing 仁卿, a native of Chenghai County 澄海縣, Guangdong 廣東, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Magistrate of Taihe County 泰和縣, Ji'an Prefecture;
Ni Dong 倪凍 (courtesy name Linzhong 霖仲, a native of Shangyu County 上虞縣, Zhejiang, and a metropolitan graduate of the jiaxu year [1574]), Magistrate of Anfu County 安福縣, Ji'an Prefecture.

